        "id": 1899057
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-11-17T18:02:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t know exactly what the controller is doing here. By the way, it has no opportunity to send the packets, acknowledged at the start.\nI suppose he likes trashing some buffers before starting...\nFor our point of view, we cannot fulfill pipeline buffering in this way.",
      "parentUuid": "4d86a36b_3ad25c02",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 39,
        "startChar": 28,
        "endLine": 39,
